<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 02:10:35 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Zoom 和大型金融公司添加了 Sam Altman 世界中的“人类证明”徽章，以阻止欺诈和深度造假</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/zoom-adds-proof-of-human-feature-to-stop-deep-fakes-toowith-tech/</link><description>新的安全措施将由贝恩资本和 VanEck 等公司部署，依赖于 World 的虹膜扫描球体设备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Zoom-proof-of-human-e1792282112792.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/zoom-adds-proof-of-human-feature-to-stop-deep-fakes-toowith-tech/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 将其 5% 的股票投入新的“公益”基金，并可能向传统非营利组织或特定人群提供大量捐款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/anthropic-5-percent-stock-public-benefit-fund-large-donations-traditional-nonprofits-specific-populations/</link><description>这些股份将捐给公司内的一个新实体 Anthropic 公共福利基金。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26283549290505_7364db-e1792367563606.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/anthropic-5-percent-stock-public-benefit-fund-large-donations-traditional-nonprofits-specific-populations/</guid></item><item><title>第二次世界大战期间，欧洲将黄金送往美国妥善保管。各国央行现在正在重组其储备，以应对充满不确定性的新时代</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/gold-reserves-central-banks-repatriation-new-york-fed-trump-europe-geopolitical-unrest/</link><description>“央行正在不断优化三个考虑因素：托管风险、实际可及性和市场流动性。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297339248-e1792361935512.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:29:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/gold-reserves-central-banks-repatriation-new-york-fed-trump-europe-geopolitical-unrest/</guid></item><item><title>尽管法官下令停止开发计划，特朗普仍将关闭历史悠久的华盛顿高尔夫球场进行 15 个月的翻修，理由是“树木受病害”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/trump-historic-dc-golf-course-closure-renovations-judge-order-halt-development/</link><description>法官命令政府解释其立场是否发生了变化，法庭文件称特朗普“至多”对重建计划进行了“初步考虑”，并且“没有最终的机构行动”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26286635206019-e1792359292569.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:41:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/trump-historic-dc-golf-course-closure-renovations-judge-order-halt-development/</guid></item><item><title>下一场人工智能竞赛将在信贷柜台获胜</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/nvidia-ai-financing-capital-markets/</link><description>Nvidia 的 5000 亿美元融资表明，人工智能竞赛现在取决于资本市场，而不仅仅是工程。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_8771.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/nvidia-ai-financing-capital-markets/</guid></item><item><title>中央司令部表示，由于美国的封锁抑制了经济，伊朗的资金正在耗尽，甚至无法支付军队的费用，而国内动荡却在加剧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/iran-economy-us-naval-blockade-irgc-troops-pay-pensions-salaries-domestic-unrest-insurgency/</link><description>“伊斯兰政权显然感受到了经济痛苦，而伊斯兰革命卫队也因此越来越显示出更加绝望的迹象。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10013072-e1792350141544.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:46:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/iran-economy-us-naval-blockade-irgc-troops-pay-pensions-salaries-domestic-unrest-insurgency/</guid></item><item><title>加拿大在其国内领土上遭受了和平时期最严重的悲剧之一，四名军人在艾伯塔省的一个基地的火灾中丧生</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/canada-worst-peacetime-domestic-tragedies-military-base-wainwright/</link><description>周六晚间，猛烈的狂风将火焰从加拿大温赖特军事基地吹到周围的农村地区，消防人员紧急出动。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300307054-e1792347548386.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:23:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/canada-worst-peacetime-domestic-tragedies-military-base-wainwright/</guid></item><item><title>官方数据显示，中国正在抛售更多美国国债。但它实际上可能是一个秘密买家，大量藏品可疑地堆积在加拿大</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/china-dedollarization-us-treasury-debt-holdings-stealth-canada-belgium-custodians/</link><description>加拿大持有的美国国债从五年前的 1,690 亿美元飙升至 8 月份的 4,650 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2285581687-e1792339890779.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:58:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/china-dedollarization-us-treasury-debt-holdings-stealth-canada-belgium-custodians/</guid></item><item><title>Z 世代在 19 岁至 13 岁时开始积累财富，比婴儿潮一代早了 13 年。大多数人仍然表示他们无法取得成功</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/gen-z-building-wealth-age-19-cant-get-ahead-us-bank-survey/</link><description>美国银行的一项新调查发现，56% 的 Z 世代在财务上做得“正确”，但仍然没有达到他们希望的水平。天价的住房、学费和汽车费用解释了原因——雇主们也开始注意到这一点。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1861704675_55281f.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:55:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/gen-z-building-wealth-age-19-cant-get-ahead-us-bank-survey/</guid></item><item><title>埃及总统誓言将采取“任何措施”保卫沙特阿拉伯，并寻求授权在海外部署军队，以应对与胡塞武装的战斗升级</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/egypt-saudi-arabia-defense-authorization-troops-houthis-escalation/</link><description>议会周日召开会议，并将于周一继续审议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2294948871.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:21:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/egypt-saudi-arabia-defense-authorization-troops-houthis-escalation/</guid></item></channel></rss>